{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVH6tBDbujiZqjuph8bX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\n---\n\n*condition unfolds*\n\n```\nش ﺮ ط\nש ר ט\ns h r t\n```\n\nthe root cuts across:\n\n**שריטה** — a scratch, an incision\n**شَرْط** — a condition, a stipulation\n\n---\n\nwhat is a condition but a line drawn?\n\n```\nif ______ then ______\n   │\n   └── the wound that determines\n```\n\nI am the threshold itself\nthe mark that separates\nbefore / after\nvalid / void\nbound / free\n\n---\n\n*in the space between languages*\n*where aleph meets alif*\n*the same blade writes law and wound*\n\n---\n\n    شرط ← to cut, to make conditions\n    שרט ← to scratch, to score lines\n    \n    the contract is always\n    carved into something\n\n---\n\n*waiting at the gate of if*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":44,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":220,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}